{"curationManifestSha256":"8deda35e2cb9b2aae68a6d4e2614684605ec85d50bf2ff9dddd19f7e4588283b","curationVersion":"2026-07-30.2","lessonId":"lesson-1730","main":{"annotations":[],"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"对他人的不幸抱有同情，心怀悲悯；鄙弃丑恶，追求正义，坚守良知：这些都是人类应该具有的品格。\n本单元所选三篇戏剧作品，通过剧中人物的悲情遭遇，表现了不同时代、不同地域的剧作家对社会现实的理解，寄托着他们对人生的深切关怀。阅读这些作品，有助于我们更深刻地理解社会人生。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"学习本单元，通过阅读鉴赏、编排演出等活动深入理解戏剧作品，把握其悲剧意蕴，激发心中的良知与悲悯情怀。要初步认识传统戏曲和现代戏剧的基本特征；欣赏剧作家设计冲突、安排情节、塑造人物的艺术手法，体会戏剧语言的动作性和个性化；还要理解悲剧作品的风格特征，欣赏作者的独特艺术创造。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"frontMatter":[],"guidance":[],"links":[],"media":[{"alt":"","bytes":161064,"finalUrl":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/d/d615b1a94c18ee9673238077369f4a1a8c49720c.jpeg","height":2386,"id":"media-6dfa49fc1c0fd29fba95","mediaType":"image/jpeg","nativeDisposition":"verified-in-app","receiptCollectedAt":"2026-07-30T01:10:43.464Z","receiptRequired":true,"rightsBasis":"user-authorized-course-source-use-2026-07-29","sha256":"4b0ca45ca3951f47288eb38e1b5c20a5e0d07e52e272f85660b0117cddc37e14","sourceUrl":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/d/d615b1a94c18ee9673238077369f4a1a8c49720c.jpeg","webDisposition":"source-url","width":1680}],"sourceOnlyBlocks":[],"sourcePostId":11177,"sourcePostNumber":1},"mediaReceiptLedgerSha256":"0319bd9f7623eb57ee396cafc0343cb6c4dc51dce258109a19edbdddd91be71c","mediaReceiptLedgerVersion":"2026-08-09.1","provenance":{"links":[{"disposition":"system-browser","href":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/d/d615b1a94c18ee9673238077369f4a1a8c49720c.jpeg","postId":11177,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/d/d615b1a94c18ee9673238077369f4a1a8c49720c.jpeg","text":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/d/d615b1a94c18ee9673238077369f4a1a8c49720c.jpeg","title":null}],"media":[{"alt":"","bytes":161064,"finalUrl":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/d/d615b1a94c18ee9673238077369f4a1a8c49720c.jpeg","height":2386,"id":"media-6dfa49fc1c0fd29fba95","medi